msgid "CartPops"
msgstr "CartPops"

#: cartpops.php
#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#. Author URI of the plugin
msgid "https://cartpops.com"
msgstr "https://cartpops.com"

#: cartpops.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"The #1 WooCommerce cart drawer plugin. Boost conversions with a beautiful "
"slide-out cart, product recommendations, and free shipping meter."
msgstr ""
"Vodilni vtičnik za izvlečno košarico za WooCommerce. Povečajte prodajo s "
"privlačno drsno košarico, priporočili izdelkov in merilnikom za brezplačno "
"dostavo."

#: cartpops.php:56
msgid ""
"CartPops detected both the Free and Pro editions as active. CartPops was "
"paused; deactivate one edition and reload this page."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je zaznal, da sta aktivni tako brezplačna kot Pro različica. "
"CartPops je začasno ustavljen; deaktivirajte eno izmed različic in znova "
"naložite to stran."

#: cartpops.php:148
msgid ""
"CartPops could not safely verify upgrade state. CartPops was paused before "
"licensing initialization; reload this page or contact support."
msgstr ""
"CartPops ni mogel varno preveriti stanja nadgradnje. CartPops je bil pred "
"inicializacijo licenciranja začasno ustavljen; znova naložite to stran ali "
"se obrnite na podporo."

#: cartpops.php:406
msgid ""
"CartPops licensing could not initialize. Shared cart features remain "
"available, but paid features are paused. Reinstall the complete CartPops "
"package or contact support."
msgstr ""
"Licenciranja za CartPops ni bilo mogoče inicializirati. Skupne funkcije "
"košarice ostajajo na voljo, plačljive funkcije pa so začasno onemogočene. "
"Znova namestite celoten paket CartPops ali se obrnite na podporo."

