#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1750
msgid ""
"CartPops could not finish updating your settings from version 1, so it is "
"paused. Your settings are safe. Reload this page to try again, and contact "
"CartPops support if this message stays."
msgstr ""
"CartPops ni mogel dokončati posodobitve vaših nastavitev iz različice 1, "
"zato je zaustavljen. Vaše nastavitve so varne. Ponovno naložite to stran in "
"se obrnite na podporo CartPops, če se to sporočilo ne bo spremenilo."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1760
msgid ""
"Your automation rules from CartPops 1 are kept, but CartPops 2 no longer "
"runs them."
msgstr ""
"Vaša pravila avtomatizacije iz CartPops 1 so ohranjena, vendar CartPops 2 "
"jih ne izvaja več."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1783
msgid ""
"CartPops updated your settings from version 1, but some could not be "
"carried over exactly. Your original settings are kept."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je posodobil vaše nastavitve iz različice 1, vendar nekaterih ni "
"bilo mogoče prenesti natančno. Vaše prvotne nastavitve so ohranjena."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1787
msgid "Hide this notice"
msgstr "Skrij to obvestilo"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1797
msgid "This review requires a site administrator and a submitted review form."
msgstr ""
"Ta recenzija zahteva administratorja spletnega mesta in poslano obrazec za "
"recenzijo."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1814
msgid ""
"The review was not accepted. Return to this site dashboard and review the "
"current notice again."
msgstr ""
"Recenzija ni bila sprejeta. Vrnite se na nadzorno ploščo tega spletnega "
"mesta in ponovno preglejte trenutno obvestilo."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1819
msgid ""
"The saved migration state could not be acknowledged. No review was "
"accepted; return to this site dashboard and try again."
msgstr ""
"Shranjenega stanja migracije ni bilo mogoče potrditi. Nobena recenzija ni "
"bila sprejeta; vrnite se na nadzorno ploščo tega spletnega mesta in "
"poskusite znova."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1827
msgid ""
"JavaScript retirement review accepted. Return to this site dashboard to "
"retry migration and review any remaining conditions. The original script is "
"preserved and will not execute in V2."
msgstr ""
"Recenzija upokojitve JavaScripta je bila sprejeta. Vrnite se na nadzorno "
"ploščo, da poskusite znova migrirati in pregledati morebitne preostale "
"pogoje. Izvirni skript je ohranjen in se v V2 ne bo izvršil."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1871
msgid "This link has expired. Return to the dashboard and try again."
msgstr "Ta povezava je potekla. Vrnite se na nadzorno ploščo in poskusite znova."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1887
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until you review your old custom JavaScript below. Your "
"settings are safe."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je zaustavljen, dokler ne pregledate starega prilagojenega "
"JavaScripta spodaj. Vaše nastavitve so varne."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1888
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until a site administrator reviews the old custom "
"JavaScript. Your settings are safe."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je zaustavljen, dokler administrator spletnega mesta ne pregleda "
"starega prilagojenega JavaScripta. Vaše nastavitve so varne."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1890
msgid ""
"CartPops is paused until its update can finish. Your settings are safe. If "
"you use CartPops Pro, check that your license is active for this site; "
"otherwise, contact CartPops support."
msgstr ""
"CartPops je zaustavljen, dokler se ne zaključi njegova posodobitev. Vaše "
"nastavitve so varne. Če uporabljate CartPops Pro, preverite, ali je vaša "
"licenca aktivna za to spletno mesto; sicer se obrnite na podporo CartPops."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1900
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "Več informacij"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1910
msgid ""
"These settings had a value CartPops 2 could not read, so they now use their "
"default. Check them in the CartPops settings:"
msgstr ""
"Te nastavitve so imele vrednost, ki je CartPops 2 ni mogel prebrati, zato "
"zdaj uporabljajo privzete vrednosti. Preverite jih v nastavitvah CartPops:"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1911
msgid "These settings no longer exist in CartPops 2:"
msgstr "Te nastavitve v CartPops 2 več ne obstajajo:"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1912
msgid "These settings now work a little differently:"
msgstr "Te nastavitve zdaj delujejo nekoliko drugače:"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1926
msgid "Your custom JavaScript from version 1 is kept but not run."
msgstr "Vaš prilagojeni JavaScript iz različice 1 je ohranjen, vendar se ne izvaja."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1929
msgid "Some Pro settings from version 1 are kept in your database but not used."
msgstr ""
"Nekatere nastavitve Pro iz različice 1 so shranjene v vaši bazi podatkov, "
"vendar se ne uporabljajo."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1935
#. translators: %d: number of other settings.
#, php-format
msgid "%d other setting could not be carried over."
msgid_plural "%d other settings could not be carried over."
msgstr[0] "%d druga nastavitev ni bila prenesena."
msgstr[1] "%d drugi nastavitvi nista bili preneseni."
msgstr[2] "%d druge nastavitve niso bile prenesene."
msgstr[3] "%d drugih nastavitev ni bilo prenesenih."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1944
msgid "See which settings"
msgstr "Oglejte si, katere nastavitve"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1962
msgid "Show your saved custom JavaScript"
msgstr "Prikažite svoj shranjen prilagojeni JavaScript"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1963
msgid ""
"Copy it somewhere safe if you want to move it into your theme or a snippets "
"plugin."
msgstr ""
"Kopirajte ga na varno mesto, če ga želite premestiti v svojo temo ali "
"vtičnik za delčke."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1966
msgid "Only the beginning is shown. The full copy remains saved in your database."
msgstr ""
"Prikazana je samo začetek. Polna kopija ostane shranjena v vaši bazi "
"podatkov."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1984
msgid "Review your old custom JavaScript"
msgstr "Preglejte svoj stari prilagojeni JavaScript"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:1985
msgid ""
"CartPops 2 does not run the custom JavaScript from version 1. It stays "
"saved in your database. Copy it if you still need it, then confirm below to "
"finish the update."
msgstr ""
"CartPops 2 ne izvaja prilagojenega JavaScripta iz različice 1. Ostane "
"shranjen v vaši bazi podatkov. Kopirajte ga, če ga še potrebujete, nato "
"potrdite spodaj, da zaključite posodobitev."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2001
msgid "I understand this custom JavaScript will not run in CartPops 2."
msgstr "Razumem, da se ta prilagojeni JavaScript ne bo izvajal v CartPops 2."

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2003
msgid "Confirm and finish the update"
msgstr "Potrdite in zaključite posodobitev"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2022
msgid "Open this site dashboard to review its migration"
msgstr "Odprite nadzorno ploščo tega spletnega mesta, da pregledate njeno selitev"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2034
msgid "Return to this site dashboard"
msgstr "Vrnite se na nadzorno ploščo tega spletnega mesta"

#: src/Setup/Upgrader.php:2035
msgid "CartPops migration review"
msgstr "Pregled selitve CartPops"

#: src/Admin/assets/js/pages/AdvancedSettings.jsx:244
msgid "Add to cart on product pages without reloading"
msgstr "Dodaj v košarico na straneh izdelkov brez osvežitve"

#: src/Admin/assets/js/pages/AdvancedSettings.jsx:248
msgid ""
"Adds the product in the background so shoppers stay on the page. The drawer "
"then opens if “Open drawer on” is set to Add to cart. Turn this off if your "
"theme or another plugin already handles product-page add to cart."
msgstr ""
"Izdelek doda v ozadju, tako da nakupovalci ostanejo na strani. Predal se "
"nato odpre, če je »Odpri predal ob« nastavljen na Dodaj v košarico. "
"Izklopite to, če vaša tema ali drug vtičnik že obravnava dodajanje v "
"košarico na strani izdelka."

#: src/Pro/Admin/assets/js/pages/ShippingMeterSettings.jsx:325
msgid "WooCommerce minimum"
msgstr "Najmanjša zahteva WooCommerce"

#: src/Pro/Admin/assets/js/pages/ShippingMeterSettings.jsx:337
msgid ""
"Free shipping comes from WooCommerce, not from this meter. Add a Free "
"shipping method with a minimum order amount to your shipping zones in "
"WooCommerce → Settings → Shipping. The meter only shows when the shopper’s "
"zone has one."
msgstr ""
"Brezplačna dostava prihaja iz WooCommerce, ne iz tega merilnika. Dodajte "
"metodo Brezplačna dostava z najmanjšim zneskom naročila v vaše cone dostave "
"v WooCommerce → Nastavitve → Dostava. Merilnik se prikaže samo, če ima cona "
"nakupovalca eno."

#: src/Pro/Admin/assets/js/pages/ShippingMeterSettings.jsx:345
msgid "Higher free shipping goal (optional)"
msgstr "Višji cilj brezplačne dostave (izbirno)"

#: src/Pro/Admin/assets/js/pages/ShippingMeterSettings.jsx:349
msgid ""
"Leave at 0 to use the minimum order amount from WooCommerce. A higher "
"amount only raises the goal shown in the meter. It does not give free "
"shipping by itself, and amounts below the WooCommerce minimum are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Pustite na 0, da uporabite najmanjši znesek naročila iz WooCommerce. Višji "
"znesek samo dvigne cilj, prikazan v merilniku. Ne daje brezplačne dostave "
"sam po sebi, in zneski pod najmanjšo zahtevo WooCommerce se prezrejo."

